{"id":"angelegenheit","lemma":"Angelegenheit","pos":"noun","rank":1983,"glosses":["matter, issue, affair"],"ipa":"/ˈanɡəleːɡn̩haɪ̯t/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c9/De-Angelegenheit.ogg/De-Angelegenheit.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Angelegenheit","plural":"Angelegenheiten"},"examples":[{"text":"Das ist meine Angelegenheit.","en":"That's my affair.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/392419","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null]},{"text":"Wie siehst du diese Angelegenheit?","en":"How do you view this matter?","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"to see","l":"sehen"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},null]},{"text":"Kann die Angelegenheit bis morgen warten?","en":"Can the matter wait till tomorrow?","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"until, to, through"},{"g":"tomorrow"},{"g":"to wait"}]},{"text":"Kümmere dich um deine eigenen Angelegenheiten!","en":"Mind your own business!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/758294","words":[{"g":"to take care","l":"kümmern"},{"g":"you","l":"du"},{"g":"around / at"},{"g":"your","l":"dein"},{"g":"own","l":"eigen"},null]},{"text":"Ich kann die Angelegenheit nicht fallen lassen.","en":"I can't let the matter drop.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/717819","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"not"},null,null],"phrases":[[5,7,"to drop"]]}]}